message: If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata in this file.
type: software
title: 'A Mechanistic Interpretation of Prescribed-Parameter Convolutional Kernels: Companion
  Code'
authors:
- given-names: Jorge
  family-names: Marco Blanco
abstract: Companion software for experiments on prescribed-parameter convolutional kernels,
  including PPV-only unit-energy ROCKET features, effective dimensionality, distance correlation,
  and classification accuracy. The experiments form part of Chapter 3 of the associated thesis.
keywords:
- time series classification
- ROCKET
- random convolutional kernels
- interpretability
- reproducibility
